        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine upgrades and unique talents, and choose each tower wisely to build the perfect castle defense!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the Castle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies as you conquer unique maps, each unlocked as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.poster.avif?t=1768747646\" width=376 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.webm?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.mp4?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle puts your strategy to the test: you start with 20 life points and must survive until you defeat the four bosses of each map… or fall trying. No matter the outcome, you’ll always be rewarded with gold coins, essential to evolve your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select talents during your battles, each with unique and random upgrades and attributes, ready to make every match unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/a4a0fa1900fd1afdfd66285a43ffa0b9.avif?t=1768747646\" width=925 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins wisely in the upgrade menu, outside of battles, where you can enhance your towers and invest in general improvements that will transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.poster.avif?t=1768747646\" width=304 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.webm?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.mp4?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine upgrades and unique talents, and choose each tower wisely to build the perfect castle defense!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the Castle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies as you conquer unique maps, each unlocked as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.poster.avif?t=1768747646\" width=376 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.webm?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/5b9ce12ebe84c6b9880c915ce6e9b0b8.mp4?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle puts your strategy to the test: you start with 20 life points and must survive until you defeat the four bosses of each map… or fall trying. No matter the outcome, you’ll always be rewarded with gold coins, essential to evolve your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select talents during your battles, each with unique and random upgrades and attributes, ready to make every match unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/a4a0fa1900fd1afdfd66285a43ffa0b9.avif?t=1768747646\" width=925 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins wisely in the upgrade menu, outside of battles, where you can enhance your towers and invest in general improvements that will transform your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.poster.avif?t=1768747646\" width=304 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.webm?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054360/extras/fb5076a1d2e7886cfcc7feefd35f05ac.mp4?t=1768747646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
